# UI-HARVEST-ICON-1 R1 (the owner's ui test, 2026-11-27: "when i scrolled/zoomed back in the icon was
# gone"). The forester's "no raw material" icon (1, KeinRohstoff) appears after the farm's 60 000-tick
# missing-input interval and clears on the first production step that makes wood (AnnoFrame
# 0x10072fb0(0x0e) at 0x10072ff1, docs/re/ui.md 11.2): at --speed 200 that is about 5 s after it
# appears (measured: icon at turn 649, wood at 703, icon off at 704). So the owner's icon was gone
# because the forester had wood, not because of the zoom. This case pins it: with the game paused while
# raw_88 is 0 the icon stays drawn through zooming out and back in to the closest zoom; unpaused, it
# clears once wood arrives.
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
wait frames 5
key b
wait frames 3
select 801
rotate 0
expect title build 801
click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait fact status_icons.count >= 1 within 200000
wait fact status_icons.drawn >= 1
key space
wait fact game.paused == 1
note fact game.ms
# A look requests a redraw, then a settled paused view can go idle immediately.
expect fact camera.tile.x <= 1145
look 1156 516
expect fact camera.tile.x >= 1150
expect fact view.drawn_tile_w == 20
expect fact inspection.raw_88 == 0
expect fact status_icons.drawn >= 1
screenshot icon_start
checkpoint icon_on_paused
# From width 20, each three-notch step divides by 1.1^3. The closest width rounds to 119.
wheel -3
wait fact view.drawn_tile_w == 15
expect fact status_icons.drawn >= 1
screenshot icon_out1
wheel -3
wait fact view.drawn_tile_w == 11
expect fact status_icons.drawn >= 1
screenshot icon_out2
wheel 40
wait fact view.drawn_tile_w == 119
expect fact zoom.at_max == 1
expect fact status_icons.drawn >= 1
expect fact inspection.raw_88 == 0
expect fact game.paused == 1
expect fact game.ms same
screenshot icon_closest
checkpoint icon_kept_through_zoom
key space
wait fact inspection.raw_88 > 0 within 600000
checkpoint wood_arrived
wait fact status_icons.count == 0 within 5000
checkpoint icon_cleared
quit
